Cell["\<\
The angle is a mean of unsigned angles, so it does not tell the sense of the \
rotation. Directions that do not move, and directions whose transport is \
blocked, are left out.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"c424f5cb-337d-40d0-a167-a34c2dc677f4"],

Cell["\<\
The form without a connection is InfraGaugeTheory's holonomy angle: the least \
angle over every choice among the best angle-isometries along the loop.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"72c999d5-b8c0-4fb6-854f-f2361d657f91"],

